便。然後加麵的部分是另外盛，不能直接加入碗裡，所以麵的Q度有跑掉 比較硬一點點🤏。由於碗是特製的，再加入唐辛子酌料後它會沉下去，在湯頭上的口感變化表現就沒那麼明顯。旁邊有檸檬水可以飲用過濾口腔味蕾，再次品嘗豚骨湯頭就沒那麼驚艷喉韻了，但整碗湯喝完喉嚨不會覺得乾渴不適。用餐過程良好 生意很好👍",null,[0,46]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/7436494959505460452/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTmtiRFJoV0Y5M1JSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7436494959505460452/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTmtiRFJoV0Y5M1JSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/7436494959505460452/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTmtiRFJoV0Y5M1JSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7436494959505460452/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTmtiRFJoV0Y5M1JSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/7436494959505460452/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTmtiRFJoV0Y5M1JSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7436494959505460452/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTmtiRFJoV0Y5M1JSQUIQAA%3D%3D"]],[null,null,11178,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNkbDRhWF93RRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x8be42c5f0dfb72cf!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICdl4aX_wE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNkbDRhWF93RRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNkbDRhWF93RRIrChRDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNkbDRaWBITQ2d3SW9hdkxyZ1lRb1BmTm5BSRouChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNkbDRiWGdBRRITQ2d3SW9hdkxyZ1lRb1BmTm5BSSISCQAAAAAAAAAAEc9y-w1fLOSLKgswX29oTFdZWnJpVg\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjZhfS699SWAxW0hGMGHQbWKHIQoykIWigL"],null,[null,[[1,0]]]],"0ahUKEwjStvq699SWAxX7SJ0JHaasODwQ0pMFCBgoAQ"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwjZhfS699SWAxW0hGMGHQbWKHIQ0pMFCEcoAQ"],[["ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQ3eGNPdl9RRRAB",["0x0:0x8be42c5f0dfb72cf",null,1724670568349518,1765283357768538,[null,null